{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31755","headline":"答王参 · 贾岛","name":"答王参","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寸晷不相待，四时互如竞。\n客思先觉秋，虫声苦知暝。\n霜松积旧翠，露月团如镜。\n诗负属景同，琴孤坐堂听。\n相期黄菊节，别约红桃径。\n每把式微篇，临风一长咏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}